{"name":"The BinOp Key","slug":"glyph-binop-key","blurb":"On the transform street, Rue carries the key toward the bracket lamp. The mark is BinOp. Click the key and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The BinOp Key.","seal":"2c54755e1a9fafee1857f856f394ae978547c756c9af458b8ef238cfeaf235e3"}
